WEBVTT

00:00:21.821 --> 00:00:24.591
Let's go and don't cry, funny

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:27.527
Give me a dumbass dream, please

00:00:27.527 --> 00:00:29.763
Don't touch me, baby

00:00:29.763 --> 00:00:32.966
Freedom, baby

00:00:32.966 --> 00:00:38.872
I'm elastic, I want to be chained

00:00:38.872 --> 00:00:43.476
Can you feel it? The nonsensical afterimage

00:00:43.476 --> 00:00:55.221
Even the moments of points and lines
disappear after failing to show

00:00:55.221 --> 00:01:00.961
The sad forefront, an empty sensation

00:01:00.961 --> 00:01:06.633
Sweet remnants that tear at my heart

00:01:06.633 --> 00:01:12.305
Scattering Polaroids, gathering paranoia

00:01:12.305 --> 00:01:17.477
I want you to tell me whose turn is next

00:01:17.477 --> 00:01:30.845
If you sleep close to this incomplete
form, you'll understand and see

00:01:32.058 --> 00:01:34.322
Is it true? Did Johann really...?

00:01:35.395 --> 00:01:38.956
After he came to deliver this today...

00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:52.267
There is no God anymore...

00:01:54.748 --> 00:01:56.383
I can't stand it anymore...

00:01:56.383 --> 00:01:59.019
Everyone, everything...

00:01:59.019 --> 00:02:05.356
Then why not just change it yourself?

00:02:18.505 --> 00:02:22.305
Everything is progressing as intended...

00:02:25.278 --> 00:02:29.215
Subject is a male in his 20s.
Black hair, scar on his right eye.

00:02:29.215 --> 00:02:32.085
Most likely using
a motorcycle of foreign make.

00:02:32.085 --> 00:02:37.045
If located, avoid contact, continue
pursuit, and wait for XAT to arrive.

00:02:44.497 --> 00:02:47.432
That man was Blue?

00:02:53.540 --> 00:02:55.075
Amanda here.

00:02:55.075 --> 00:02:58.411
Meet up with Brad
in the East Ward immediately.

00:02:58.411 --> 00:03:02.745
Possible Amalgam traces
have been found on Gallery Street.

00:03:03.750 --> 00:03:05.752
Wouldn't one person be enough for that?

00:03:05.752 --> 00:03:09.389
Judging from these traces,
it might still be in the vicinity.

00:03:09.389 --> 00:03:12.483
Okay. Got it.

00:03:16.596 --> 00:03:18.465
Why did you send Amanda too?

00:03:18.465 --> 00:03:22.902
I just felt it was best to be safe.
Should I not have done that?

00:03:22.902 --> 00:03:24.604
It's fine...

00:03:24.604 --> 00:03:26.606
Are your injuries all right?

00:03:26.606 --> 00:03:28.441
Yeah...

00:03:28.441 --> 00:03:31.311
Perhaps you should go to the medical center?

00:03:31.311 --> 00:03:34.214
I can contact you if Blue is located.

00:03:34.214 --> 00:03:36.307
Yeah, good idea.

00:04:10.016 --> 00:04:12.519
What was that?

00:04:12.519 --> 00:04:15.889
There's no need to worry.

00:04:15.889 --> 00:04:21.995
You've been chosen, Wolf Gîring. That's all.

00:04:21.995 --> 00:04:24.623
By the new world to come.

00:04:29.702 --> 00:04:33.306
Joseph, how long are you
going to hang around this town?

00:04:33.306 --> 00:04:36.109
They know who you are now!

00:04:36.109 --> 00:04:40.409
The lousy police and XAT
are desperately looking for...

00:04:42.916 --> 00:04:46.319
Sheesh!

00:04:46.319 --> 00:04:49.482
There's such a thing as
too unbeautiful, you know.

00:05:04.637 --> 00:05:06.104
It couldn't be!

00:05:12.612 --> 00:05:14.273
Malek...

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:24.958
Hey, this whole Johann
thing... We gonna be alright?

00:05:24.958 --> 00:05:27.961
We could get expelled if she blames us for it.

00:05:27.961 --> 00:05:33.399
We'll be fine! My old man
had the principal pay her off!

00:05:33.399 --> 00:05:38.571
Still, what if Malek says something?
His sister's in XAT, you know!

00:05:38.571 --> 00:05:44.244
So what? He should've
died with Johann anyway.

00:05:44.244 --> 00:05:51.317
It's 'cause of the Outsiders that
we have demons in our country now!

00:05:51.317 --> 00:05:54.187
All these immigrants
should just leave our country!

00:05:54.187 --> 00:05:56.382
You can say that again!

00:06:21.147 --> 00:06:23.750
This should help for a while.

00:06:23.750 --> 00:06:30.623
Is this for real? It's hard to
believe I've turned into an Amalgam too.

00:06:30.623 --> 00:06:34.627
I haven't even come into
contact with Amalgam blood...

00:06:34.627 --> 00:06:38.097
Direct contact isn't the only way.

00:06:38.097 --> 00:06:41.968
Were you injured at any
point while fighting them?

00:06:41.968 --> 00:06:44.537
Injured?

00:06:44.537 --> 00:06:47.206
Now that you mention it...

00:06:47.206 --> 00:06:51.911
The issue is not the blood, but
the nanomachines lurking inside it.

00:06:51.911 --> 00:06:54.047
Nanomachines?

00:06:54.047 --> 00:06:59.986
Amalgams are infused with
normally undetectable nanomachines.

00:06:59.986 --> 00:07:05.925
But we fully analyzed Amalgam
blood. We never found anything...

00:07:05.925 --> 00:07:07.860
Of course not.

00:07:07.860 --> 00:07:11.397
The proteins dissolve within
a minute of exposure to the air,

00:07:11.397 --> 00:07:13.366
leaving no evidence behind.

00:07:13.366 --> 00:07:15.335
But if they infect another person,

00:07:15.335 --> 00:07:19.572
they'll eat away at the body and
multiply at an astronomical rate.

00:07:19.572 --> 00:07:22.275
And then... the person evolves.

00:07:22.275 --> 00:07:25.972
Evolves? Those things are evolved?

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:31.284
They only look like monsters if you ask me.

00:07:31.284 --> 00:07:33.186
Look at this.

00:07:33.186 --> 00:07:40.426
A Scaly-foot. A species of
shellfish found 2400 meters underwater.

00:07:40.426 --> 00:07:44.897
This is the world's first
creature to possess iron scales.

00:07:44.897 --> 00:07:46.632
Iron scales?

00:07:46.632 --> 00:07:51.571
Yes. These scales are made of iron sulfide.

00:07:51.571 --> 00:07:56.509
You could say it's one
final form that life has reached.

00:07:56.509 --> 00:08:02.281
These nanomachines accelerate
the same sort of biological evolution.

00:08:02.281 --> 00:08:07.019
I don't mean to get too technical
with a military musclehead like you,

00:08:07.019 --> 00:08:11.023
but the nanomachines
affect a person's proteins.

00:08:11.023 --> 00:08:14.961
They only act on those specific molecules.

00:08:14.961 --> 00:08:19.031
Think of them as keys and keyholes.

00:08:19.031 --> 00:08:23.202
The nanomachines (the keys)
Enter the proteins (the keyholes)

00:08:23.202 --> 00:08:25.471
And then alter their structure.

00:08:25.471 --> 00:08:28.207
They enhance them at the genetic level.

00:08:28.207 --> 00:08:32.645
The altered proteins bring
about a dramatic change:

00:08:32.645 --> 00:08:36.749
They complete tens of thousands
of years of evolution in one moment.

00:08:36.749 --> 00:08:40.019
Amalgams are not monsters at all.

00:08:40.019 --> 00:08:45.658
They're simply people who
have taken an evolutional shortcut.

00:08:45.658 --> 00:08:48.694
Skin that can endure all manners
of impacts and temperatures.

00:08:48.694 --> 00:08:51.631
Steel bodies that can even survive space.

00:08:51.631 --> 00:08:54.233
People can become this strong.

00:08:54.233 --> 00:08:56.169
Only those who are chosen, anyway.

00:08:56.169 --> 00:08:58.571
Those who are chosen?

00:08:58.571 --> 00:09:02.608
It's common for the weak
and inept to be weeded out

00:09:02.608 --> 00:09:05.378
during the evolutionary process.

00:09:05.378 --> 00:09:09.482
Only the chosen few can travel
the evolutionary path that gods take,

00:09:09.482 --> 00:09:12.185
and that evolution never ends.

00:09:12.185 --> 00:09:15.521
Eventually, another will
be chosen from the group

00:09:15.521 --> 00:09:18.591
and the Blassreiter will be born.

00:09:18.591 --> 00:09:21.661
Blassreiter...

00:09:21.661 --> 00:09:24.597
You're a candidate too, you know.

00:09:24.597 --> 00:09:27.464
Because you've already been chosen.

00:09:29.402 --> 00:09:33.806
Wolf Gîring, Chosen One...

00:09:33.806 --> 00:09:37.207
I'm sure that you, if anyone can...

00:09:39.745 --> 00:09:43.082
But, there's one thing you must beware.

00:09:43.082 --> 00:09:48.654
The Amalgam that you
call "Blue"...His name is...

00:09:48.654 --> 00:09:51.691
Joseph Jobson.

00:09:51.691 --> 00:09:55.027
Joseph... Jobson...

00:09:55.027 --> 00:10:01.434
He will mercilessly kill anyone
he believes has been infected.

00:10:01.434 --> 00:10:05.137
Whether or not that person
still retains their humanity.

00:10:05.137 --> 00:10:09.164
Watch out for Joseph...

00:10:17.884 --> 00:10:21.420
This is just dried-up garbage.

00:10:21.420 --> 00:10:23.122
It's not an Amalgam.

00:10:23.122 --> 00:10:28.895
According to Mei-Fong,
an Amalgam could be lurking nearby...

00:10:28.895 --> 00:10:31.090
That big one there?

00:10:33.566 --> 00:10:35.635
I see you like jokes, too.

00:10:35.635 --> 00:10:37.537
I guess.

00:10:37.537 --> 00:10:42.208
Say, Brad. Is that thing on your
chest for a superstition or something?

00:10:42.208 --> 00:10:43.910
This?

00:10:43.910 --> 00:10:47.213
Well, I guess you could say that.

00:10:47.213 --> 00:10:51.584
Anyway, it's a real shame about Malek's friend.

00:10:51.584 --> 00:10:53.219
Yeah...

00:10:53.219 --> 00:10:55.653
How's Malek handling it?

00:10:56.756 --> 00:11:00.560
Until now, I probably
would've said he'll be fine,

00:11:00.560 --> 00:11:06.430
but I guess he still is a
boy who needs my protection.

00:11:09.168 --> 00:11:12.238
I need to be there for him more...

00:11:12.238 --> 00:11:14.740
He knows.

00:11:14.740 --> 00:11:17.910
He knows how you feel.

00:11:17.910 --> 00:11:21.539
- I hope so, anyway.
- Don't worry.

00:11:27.520 --> 00:11:29.255
Let's go, Amanda!

00:11:29.255 --> 00:11:31.958
Right!

00:11:31.958 --> 00:11:33.993
Malek...

00:11:33.993 --> 00:11:37.229
Tell us what you want already.

00:11:37.229 --> 00:11:39.131
What the hell's your deal?

00:11:39.131 --> 00:11:42.868
Besides, I thought we told
you never to come to school?

00:11:42.868 --> 00:11:48.207
Come on, now. He wants
to play with us. Right, Malek?

00:11:48.207 --> 00:11:51.344
Got no friends now that Johann's dead, huh?

00:11:51.344 --> 00:11:55.081
But I thought I told you to mark
yourself when you come to school

00:11:55.081 --> 00:11:57.817
so that we can distinguish you!

00:11:57.817 --> 00:12:01.320
I'll draw one now. Don't go erasing it again!

00:12:01.320 --> 00:12:06.392
There's no need now. I already have a mark.

00:12:06.392 --> 00:12:11.197
The mark you drew was wrong.

00:12:11.197 --> 00:12:13.299
What're you talking about?

00:12:13.299 --> 00:12:17.336
What do you mean it was wrong?

00:12:17.336 --> 00:12:23.042
What I mean is, this is my real mark.

00:12:23.042 --> 00:12:24.810
That's...!

00:12:24.810 --> 00:12:28.547
A Demoniac's?! How...?

00:12:28.547 --> 00:12:32.585
Power has finally chosen the just.

00:12:32.585 --> 00:12:35.315
You're all rotten!

00:12:36.789 --> 00:12:41.827
So what do you say we play a judgment game?

00:12:41.827 --> 00:12:44.664
It was your favorite game, remember?

00:12:44.664 --> 00:12:48.134
We can call it a survival game.

00:12:48.134 --> 00:12:52.738
S-Stop! Stop!

00:12:52.738 --> 00:12:55.741
P-Please! Stop!

00:12:55.741 --> 00:13:01.646
You should've stopped the
first time Johann said that to you.

00:13:03.516 --> 00:13:06.952
Are you watching, Johann?

00:13:06.952 --> 00:13:12.390
God wouldn't punish them for us,
but now that I have this strength...

00:13:17.930 --> 00:13:20.766
That boy has fallen.

00:13:20.766 --> 00:13:22.131
Malek!

00:13:32.712 --> 00:13:34.914
I-It's Blue!

00:13:34.914 --> 00:13:37.178
It's Blue! Contact XAT!

00:13:39.952 --> 00:13:43.255
Emergency message! Blue has
broken through Checkpoint E1!

00:13:43.255 --> 00:13:47.927
Moving toward E3! All
police vehicles are in pursuit!

00:13:47.927 --> 00:13:50.129
XAT backup requested!

00:13:50.129 --> 00:13:52.256
Commencing pursuit!

00:13:57.336 --> 00:14:00.272
- That was him!
- Blue spotted at E3!

00:14:00.272 --> 00:14:03.175
Moving north on Hutt Street!

00:14:03.175 --> 00:14:07.279
There's a river ahead. Split
up and execute a pincer attack!

00:14:07.279 --> 00:14:08.610
Roger!

00:14:09.949 --> 00:14:15.251
He will mercilessly kill anyone
he believes has been infected.

00:14:19.158 --> 00:14:20.853
This is the XAT command vehicle!

00:14:23.095 --> 00:14:24.096
Boss!

00:14:24.096 --> 00:14:27.099
An Amalgam has been spotted
on a Linden School security camera!

00:14:27.099 --> 00:14:29.802
- Ls it Blue?!
- No, it's a different one!

00:14:29.802 --> 00:14:33.272
It appears to be attacking students!

00:14:33.272 --> 00:14:36.208
Squad 1 is nearby! Let's send them...

00:14:36.208 --> 00:14:39.311
No, focus all resources on Blue!

00:14:39.311 --> 00:14:43.482
- We have to take him down!
- But, the students!

00:14:43.482 --> 00:14:46.585
Oh, right...

00:14:46.585 --> 00:14:48.788
Send Squad 1.

00:14:48.788 --> 00:14:51.390
Y-Yes, sir.

00:14:51.390 --> 00:14:52.725
This is command vehicle!

00:14:52.725 --> 00:14:57.997
Another Amalgam has appeared!
Squad 1, hurry to Linden School!

00:14:57.997 --> 00:14:59.532
We're going after Blue!

00:14:59.532 --> 00:15:02.262
Al! Brad! Keep him in check!

00:15:03.135 --> 00:15:05.604
All set!

00:15:05.604 --> 00:15:07.504
Ready here!

00:15:25.724 --> 00:15:28.022
He jumped this distance?!

00:15:30.062 --> 00:15:31.530
Is this for real?!

00:15:31.530 --> 00:15:33.666
Which way do we go now?!

00:15:33.666 --> 00:15:35.501
Guess that bridge is our only option.

00:15:35.501 --> 00:15:37.469
Mei-Fong! Track Blue!

00:15:37.469 --> 00:15:38.771
Roger!

00:15:38.771 --> 00:15:43.275
He appears to be heading for
the Amalgam at Linden School.

00:15:43.275 --> 00:15:47.046
Squad 1, keep an eye out for Blue.

00:15:47.046 --> 00:15:49.181
As for Squad 2, Al and
Amanda go to the school.

00:15:49.181 --> 00:15:52.952
Brad, prepare to snipe from
the roof of the nearby Kaiser Building.

00:15:52.952 --> 00:15:54.613
Roger!

00:16:01.794 --> 00:16:04.263
Captain! The kids!

00:16:04.263 --> 00:16:07.096
This is Squad 1! Victims confirmed!

00:16:16.742 --> 00:16:19.612
Their judgment is over.

00:16:19.612 --> 00:16:22.114
Operation commence!

00:16:22.114 --> 00:16:24.783
Nobody ever came for me or Johann...

00:16:24.783 --> 00:16:26.518
Split up!

00:16:26.518 --> 00:16:29.889
...but they come right away for those rich kids!

00:16:29.889 --> 00:16:31.550
It's all screwed up!

00:16:35.127 --> 00:16:38.297
Stop! It's pointless!

00:16:38.297 --> 00:16:41.967
Keep shooting and I won't hold back either!

00:16:41.967 --> 00:16:44.367
I'm serious!

00:16:46.205 --> 00:16:47.039
It disappeared!

00:16:47.039 --> 00:16:52.344
Brad here! Amalgam is at the
kill-point, currently fighting Squad 1!

00:16:52.344 --> 00:16:56.715
Sending thermal imaging
now! Analyze it for me!

00:16:56.715 --> 00:17:00.185
I can't hit a target moving
that fast from this distance!

00:17:00.185 --> 00:17:03.489
Even if it stops for a moment,
it'll just move the instant I shoot!

00:17:03.489 --> 00:17:05.218
What should I do, Mei-Fong?!

00:17:08.360 --> 00:17:12.464
Blue must be planning to
make contact with that Amalgam.

00:17:12.464 --> 00:17:16.201
I think our best chance is when
they stop to intimidate each other!

00:17:16.201 --> 00:17:19.204
Use the thermal sensor
and shoot through obstacles

00:17:19.204 --> 00:17:21.006
so they can't see the line of fire!

00:17:21.006 --> 00:17:22.701
Got it!

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:36.555
Joseph?!

00:17:36.555 --> 00:17:39.091
Malek... Why?!

00:17:39.091 --> 00:17:41.160
I'm not a weakling anymore!

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:44.596
I'm going to use this
power to make the world right!

00:17:44.596 --> 00:17:46.427
You don't get it!

00:17:50.903 --> 00:17:53.639
- Stop right there!
- We'll take over from here!

00:17:53.639 --> 00:17:54.833
Thanks!

00:17:58.444 --> 00:17:59.934
Amanda...

00:18:21.800 --> 00:18:25.671
He protected the other one?!

00:18:25.671 --> 00:18:27.239
Now! Get Blue!

00:18:27.239 --> 00:18:31.410
Stop it!

00:18:31.410 --> 00:18:33.579
What're you doing, Amanda?! Shoot!

00:18:33.579 --> 00:18:36.115
That voice...

00:18:36.115 --> 00:18:37.776
Stop! Amanda!

00:18:40.119 --> 00:18:42.019
Can it be?!

00:18:47.726 --> 00:18:48.694
Malek?!

00:18:48.694 --> 00:18:50.696
All out of shields now!

00:18:50.696 --> 00:18:53.699
Now stay right there!

00:18:53.699 --> 00:18:55.030
Gotcha!

00:19:05.010 --> 00:19:07.046
What are you doing, Amanda?!

00:19:07.046 --> 00:19:09.913
Move, Amanda! You're in Brad's way!

00:19:12.985 --> 00:19:14.646
Bastard!

00:19:17.456 --> 00:19:22.127
Damn! Brad! Follow them! Let's go, Amanda!

00:19:22.127 --> 00:19:23.560
Right!

00:19:26.698 --> 00:19:28.529
Get on!

00:19:32.504 --> 00:19:33.835
Hurry!

00:19:44.249 --> 00:19:46.018
Amanda!

00:19:46.018 --> 00:19:50.522
Those eyes... They were Malek's!

00:19:50.522 --> 00:19:53.821
But... why?!

00:19:58.797 --> 00:20:02.701
Amalgam and Blue have breached
the Meeres Bridge checkpoint!

00:20:02.701 --> 00:20:04.896
Unable to track any further!

00:20:10.943 --> 00:20:12.978
I've lost Blue...

00:20:12.978 --> 00:20:16.072
Damn it! We were so close!

00:20:18.183 --> 00:20:22.176
Amanda! Why did you get in my line of fire?

00:20:23.856 --> 00:20:26.859
I nearly killed you, you know!

00:20:26.859 --> 00:20:28.520
I'm sorry...

00:20:31.630 --> 00:20:34.933
Umm... Amanda...

00:20:34.933 --> 00:20:39.805
A security camera
caught that Amalgam on tape...

00:20:39.805 --> 00:20:41.740
It caught his real form, too...

00:20:41.740 --> 00:20:43.442
Seriously?!

00:20:43.442 --> 00:20:45.144
It's Malek, isn't it?

00:20:45.144 --> 00:20:46.805
W-What?!

00:20:59.791 --> 00:21:02.828
Malek...

00:21:02.828 --> 00:21:06.662
I'm... not a weakling anymore!

00:21:13.172 --> 00:21:17.768
I won't let anyone bully the weak anymore!

00:21:47.139 --> 00:21:55.013
The ever-flowing songs search my memory

00:21:55.013 --> 00:22:07.125
The pain etched out by the
times slowly brings me back

00:22:07.125 --> 00:22:10.362
Embrace the sadness

00:22:10.362 --> 00:22:17.803
I know, the days that have passed by

00:22:17.803 --> 00:22:22.307
When I look up, it doesn't spill down

00:22:22.307 --> 00:22:28.880
As it trickles down the window,
sad rain rattles the heated isolation

00:22:28.880 --> 00:22:34.253
Tonight I will be forsaken by sleep

00:22:34.253 --> 00:22:42.060
It's almost as if I'm traveling
to a country no one's ever heard of

00:22:42.060 --> 00:22:48.400
I'm all alone, and my words
don't get through to anyone

00:22:48.400 --> 00:22:50.469
Wow wow

00:22:50.469 --> 00:22:58.477
Now my heart is frozen and waiting

00:22:58.477 --> 00:23:05.576
because it wants a phone
call so it can connect with you

00:23:13.325 --> 00:23:16.094
A shepherd guides the lost sheep.

00:23:16.094 --> 00:23:18.397
He has the smile of a saint

00:23:18.397 --> 00:23:20.999
and sings to himself the song of destruction.

00:23:20.999 --> 00:23:25.804
Episode 9: "The Price and the Meaning of Power."

00:23:25.804 --> 00:23:30.104
Yet another stake of ordeals
is hammered into the stigmata scars.
